#: src/main.glade:122
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks "
"to the camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps ("
"or in daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to kee"
"p unlocking reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Upisan je samo jedan model lica. Osvetljenje menja kako vaše lice izgl"
"eda pred kamerom, tako da jedan model može da pokvari uveče pod lampam"
"a (ili na dnevnom svetlu). Dodajte drugi model snimljen u drugačijem s"
"vjetlu kako bi otključavanje bilo pouzdano u bilo koje doba dana."

